"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="771" height="784" viewBox="0 0 771 784" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="linework-69qk2a738-title" aria-describedby="linework-69qk2a738-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="linework-69qk2a738-title">Checkout</title><desc id="linework-69qk2a738-desc">Sequence diagram. 4 participants and 9 messages.

Participants
- Person
- Web shop
  - Storefront (Web app)
  - Orders (Service)
- Stripe (Payments)

Message flow
In order, top to bottom.
- 1. Person calls Storefront: Place order.
- 2. Storefront calls Orders: POST /orders.
- 3. Orders calls Stripe: Create payment.
- Alternative: Paid
  - 4. Stripe replies to Orders: succeeded.
  - 5. Orders replies to Storefront: 201 Created.
  - 6. Storefront replies to Person: Confirmation.
- Else: Declined
  - 7. Stripe replies to Orders: card_declined.
  - 8. Orders replies to Storefront: 402 Payment required.
  - 9. Storefront replies to Person: Card declined, try another.

Key
- Arrow with a filled head: Call
- Dashed arrow: Reply</desc><defs></defs><rect width="771" height="784" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M750 12H759V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 772H12V763" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M750 772H759V763" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Checkout</text><g transform="translate(40 84)"><g><g transform="translate(0 0)"><rect x="180" y="0" width="332" height="606" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><text x="194" y="20.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">WEB SHOP</text><rect x="5.5" y="236" width="656.6" height="340" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M5.5 408H662" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M58 86V594" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-opacity="0.75" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="1.5 4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M260 86V594" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-opacity="0.75" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="1.5 4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M440 86V594" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-opacity="0.75" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="1.5 4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M631 86V594" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-opacity="0.75" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="1.5 4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="255" y="134" width="10" height="254" rx="3" fill="#E3F0F5" stroke="#1E7495" stroke-opacity="0.55" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="435" y="178" width="10" height="166" rx="3" fill="#E6EDF6" stroke="#2B62A3" stroke-opacity="0.55" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="626" y="222" width="10" height="78" rx="3" fill="#E7F1E5" stroke="#3D7938" stroke-opacity="0.55" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="6.1" y="236.6" width="38.6" height="24" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4"/><path d="M5.5 256V244Q5.5 236 13.5 236H40V250Q40 256 34 256Z" fill="#F5EEDD"/><text x="13.5" y